{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRJPjU8u385EPx6dRDf4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the overflow in `styles.css`. I haven't checked it in a browser or run any tests.\n\nThe `.cta` button had a fixed `width: 420px`, and `white-space: nowrap` stopped its long label from wrapping. At 375px wide the card only has 343px available (375px minus the 16px padding on each side), so the button ran off the screen.\n\nI made three changes to `.cta`:\n- **`width: 100%` with `max-width: 420px`:** the button shrinks to fit the card and still tops out at 420px on larger screens.\n- **`box-sizing: border-box`:** the padding and border now count inside that width instead of adding to it.\n- **`white-space: normal`:** the label wraps onto two lines on narrow screens instead of forcing the button wider."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":608,"cache_read_input_tokens":23181,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":608},"output_tokens":254,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea722e3e-4c75-4c84-88ed-e94475edd1c9","uuid":"49952c6e-3f48-4f11-9026-d6b0f3f28b7a","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:26:42.160Z","request_id":"req_011ChRJPjHxe8pZMPHUy3sP6"}
